{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0ElMjBDaHJpc3RtYXMlMjBOdW1iZXIlMjBPbmUlMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"A Christmas Number One","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1qkUG6UcUXwkrobQOtWfjcPQr76.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/h0QfGN4PjovosbfsvEn3Tujf56z.jpg","description":"Meg, a music manager, travels from New York to London to manage a boy band, Five Together, and find them a Christmas number one to bolster their flagging career.  She finds a song on the internet posted by an ailing thirteen-year-old girl, Nina, and tries to obtain permission to have the song re-recorded by Five Together, but she discovers she has competition from the songwriter, Nina’s uncle Blake. What follows is a romantic comedy about two worlds colliding – with a young woman at the centre who desperately wants her uncle to find love and for his song to hit the number one spot by Christmas Day.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Romance","Comedy","Music","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.5","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Freida Pinto","Iwan Rheon","Helena Zengel","Alfie Boe","Debi Mazar","Richard Fleeshman","Georgia Small","Joe Lycett"],"director":["Chris Cottam"],"released":"2021-12-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Freida Pinto","character":"Meghna Rai","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tub18dfDNMxlempVIuPXh8fmZVs.jpg"},{"name":"Iwan Rheon","character":"Blake Cutter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xF8bGBL6nUYH9QrXAbah1VQIHU4.jpg"},{"name":"Helena Zengel","character":"Nina Cutter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6ousX9QcimaM2tuaeBcqYEfBjKG.jpg"},{"name":"Alfie Boe","character":"Grainger Cocksmith","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1GsNw2SVw9FvIqhTxOHnGDWX3aG.jpg"},{"name":"Debi Mazar","character":"Colleen Porter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ooBzVPkWjGkk6YDV1lzWwtBoNPv.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Fleeshman","character":"Rannelle Spear","photo":"https://